  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump the Nix package to 1.19.2 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1429\n* Run embedded commands on their own connection, with cancel and per-command user by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1430\n* Write less on pause and resume by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1433\n* Refuse machine exec --user on a bare VM instead of running as root by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1432\n* Carry the host's proxy and trusted certificates into a machine on request by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1431\n* Fix Windows machines failing to boot in v1.19.0 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1439\n* Bump the workspace to 1.19.3 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1440\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.19.2...v1.19.3",
